<title>USA: Peoples Telephone Co cuts Q4 oper loss.</title>
<headline>Peoples Telephone Co cuts Q4 oper loss.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.26     loss	 $0.66</p>
<p> Net loss		   3,910     loss	10,403</p>
<p> Revs			31,508		   32,517</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  16,195		   16,108</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.05     loss	 $1.43</p>
<p> Net loss		  15,992     loss	22,467</p>
<p> Revs		     124,957		  138,391</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  16,188		   16,091</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 cash flow per share from continuing operations: positive $0.33 vs negative $0.12.</p>
<p>Year cash flow per share from continuing operations: positive $1.29 vs positive $0.51.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 excludes a charge of $311,000, or $0.02 a share, from extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>1996 year excludes loss from discontinued operations of $12.1 million and a loss of $3.3 million from the extinguishment of debt.</p>
